        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='position:relative;width:1870px;height:1450px;background:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;overflow:hidden'><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:30px;width:1790px;border-top:3px solid #0f172a'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:42px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6d28d9'>Twilite Zone · Library</div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:70px;width:1790px;border-top:1px solid #0f172a'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:96px;width:1790px;font:500 72px/74px Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.025em'>Edge classes</div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:188px;width:900px;font:italic 400 22px/30px Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#475569'>The eleven connections the library defines. Each has a page that says what it joins, how many, and why.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:290px;width:1790px;border-top:3px solid #6d28d9'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:312px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6d28d9'>Showing</div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:338px;width:170px;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#475569'>How a graph presents itself, and where it lands.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:580px;width:1790px;border-top:1px solid #0f172a'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:602px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f172a'>Boundaries</div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:628px;width:170px;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#475569'>The edge of a graph, and what it offers there.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:870px;width:1790px;border-top:1px solid #0f172a'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:892px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f172a'>Behavior</div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:918px;width:170px;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#475569'>What sets a graph’s Methods running.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:1160px;width:1790px;border-top:1px solid #0f172a'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:1182px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f172a'>Between graphs</div><div style='position:absolute;left:40px;top:1208px;width:170px;font:400 14px/20px system-ui;color:#475569'>How one graph reaches another.</div></div>"
        }
      },
      "positionLocked": true
    },
